OL,3,GNEWSAAfter 323 days adventurer nears
OL,4,Aend of epic oceans row
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe hopes to arrive on the Kenyan coast
OL,7,Fon Saturday. He is using the trip to
OL,8,Fraise money for Rock2Recovery, a
OL,9,Fcharity helping veterans and blue light
OL,10,Fworkers suffering from PTSD.
